WEBVTT

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:33.130
<b>Old Capital</b>

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:32.880
Welcome.

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:34.860
It's the middle of summer,

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:38.700
and it's the big trip that 
everyone's looking forward to.

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:41.030
Yeah, let's go on a class trip!

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:43.870
We're not advertising the place!

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:46.580
And this is a training 
excursion, you know.

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:48.650
We're not high schoolers.

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:51.840
Ah, so that's why 
Konohamaru is here, too.

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:57.840
But getting today off to visit the
old capital is a rare treat for us.

00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:05.390
I want to visit all the 
sights with everyone!

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:07.710
Everyone?

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:10.520
You're only imagining Sakura...

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:14.230
Regardless, let's go 
out and have a blast!

00:02:14.670 --> 00:02:16.550
Yay!

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:26.910
<b>A Field Trip to the Old Capital!</b>

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:30.920
You're all free for the rest of the day!

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:33.550
I wanna go see the temples.

00:02:33.550 --> 00:02:37.260
I'm going to buy some oil blotting paper
from the makeup store in Kawara.

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:39.090
Oh, yeah! That, too!

00:02:40.950 --> 00:02:47.040
<b>Rock's Eats</b>

00:02:41.130 --> 00:02:42.740
I'd like some as well.

00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:44.480
I'll go with you, Sakura.

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:47.060
Lee, they're for blotting 
oil off your face...

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:51.990
Now we'll have a lottery 
to form groups of three!

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:49.960
<b>Lottery</b>

00:02:51.990 --> 00:02:53.520
Lottery?!

00:02:56.610 --> 00:03:00.970
<i>I've got a chance to be in 
the same group as Sakura.</i>

00:03:00.970 --> 00:03:02.810
<i>We're on the same team.</i>

00:03:02.810 --> 00:03:05.950
<i>I figured it'd be a given for me.</i>

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:08.070
<i>I know what you're thinking, Naruto.</i>

00:03:08.070 --> 00:03:10.790
<i>Bushy-Brows wants in, too.</i>

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:13.260
I'll be in Sakura's group,

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:16.300
and there's nothing you can do about it!

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:27.310
Loser

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:33.440
Remember to meet back at 
the inn in three hours!

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:34.930
Yes!

00:03:34.930 --> 00:03:37.250
Let's go, ladies!

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:39.780
What's first, the temples or shopping?

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:41.570
Tough call.

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:43.240
Hold it, you!

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:48.020
Please, Konohamaru, trade teams with me.

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:49.750
No, no, no, trade with me.

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:51.650
You're scaring me.

00:03:51.650 --> 00:03:52.790
Enough!

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:55.520
Ow...

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:57.330
Rules are rules.

00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:58.540
No cheating.

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:01.190
Why do I have to be stuck with Naruto?

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:03.540
Excuse me, that's my line!

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:05.550
Remember, you two.

00:04:06.670 --> 00:04:08.480
I expect you to behave.

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:12.180
Anyone who starts causing trouble 
gets stuck sitting in their room...

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:14.810
...on their knees.

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:18.020
Us cause trouble? No way, right, Naruto?

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:19.860
Indeed, Bushy-Brows!

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:22.350
<i>Guess there's no getting out of this.</i>

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:25.470
<i>We'll have to settle for going 
to the same places as Sakura.</i>

00:04:25.470 --> 00:04:27.560
<i>Agreed.</i>

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:31.620
So, Sakura, where are 
you all headed first?

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:33.430
Hey, they're gone!

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:37.710
Sakura?!

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:39.470
Ouch!

00:04:40.140 --> 00:04:43.420
'Scuse me. 
You punks just stepped on my foot!

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:44.610
I'm terribly sorry.

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:46.220
My apologies.

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:50.560
You call that an apology?

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:52.060
Where ya from? What school?

00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:54.060
Sakura's cool.

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:56.160
Not what's cool, stupid! What school?!

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:59.060
Looks like we gotta teach you a lesson.

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:00.930
We're gonna have to whoop these chumps.

00:05:00.930 --> 00:05:03.770
I don't want to be forced to sit 
on my knees for causing trouble.

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:06.740
They're picking a fight, and if we don't
stand up to them, it makes us cowards!

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:08.340
I'm no coward!

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:11.310
But if we fight them, 
we'll be like autumn skies to a flame.

00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:13.860
Get it right! 
It's "like roundworms to a flame!"

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:17.920
No! It's "fly, fly, fly, flutter, flutter!"

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:21.910
You're both wrong. 
It's "like moths to a flame!"

00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:25.260
Why are we arguing 
about their argument?!

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:27.430
Eat this!

00:05:34.340 --> 00:05:36.450
Where'd they go?!

00:05:39.470 --> 00:05:43.340
Ugh, if I hadn't used 
the Replacement Jutsu,

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:45.030
you'd have caused a huge scene.

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:48.930
It's because Naruto wanted to 
fight with those delinquents!

00:05:48.930 --> 00:05:51.470
Yeah, because you stepped on his foot!

00:05:51.470 --> 00:05:52.960
So did you!

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:53.700
Listen to me.

00:05:54.140 --> 00:05:57.410
I don't have time to argue with you.

00:05:57.410 --> 00:05:58.660
I have to go after Sakura!

00:05:58.660 --> 00:06:00.470
Yeah! Me, too!

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:05.130
Why must I get dragged into this?

00:06:10.530 --> 00:06:13.470
What're we doing at a temple?

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:15.810
Tenten and Sakura were saying...

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:19.450
<i>What's first, the temples or shopping?</i>

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:20.940
<i>Tough call.</i>

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:22.980
This was one option.

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:25.810
N-Naruto?

00:06:26.960 --> 00:06:28.320
Lady Hinata!

00:06:28.850 --> 00:06:30.400
What's up?

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:33.800
Um... uh...

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:37.040
Don't overreact. Let her speak.

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:38.790
I know, I know.

00:06:39.110 --> 00:06:43.140
I really want to hurry to the next 
place and look for Sakura...

00:06:43.140 --> 00:06:45.060
So do I, but―

00:06:45.060 --> 00:06:47.530
We move as a team!

00:06:49.610 --> 00:06:51.090
Um...

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:52.850
Five minutes later.

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:55.350
Er...

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:58.810
Ten minutes later.

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:01.770
Uh...

00:07:03.050 --> 00:07:05.150
Twenty minutes later.

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:07.610
Um!

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:10.860
We're lucky we got such nice weather!

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:12.610
That was it?!

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:17.760
You two...

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:22.040
How dare you hurt Lady Hinata's feelings?!

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:32.470
We totally lost them...

00:07:32.730 --> 00:07:34.480
This is your fault, Bushy-Brows!

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:35.670
Was not!

00:07:35.670 --> 00:07:38.210
You poured the oil on the fire!

00:07:38.210 --> 00:07:39.390
O-Oil...

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:44.230
<i>I'm going to buy some oil blotting paper
from the makeup store in Kawara.</i>

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:44.980
Oil!

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:46.360
Oil blotting paper!

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:50.880
<b>Oil Blotting Paper</b>

00:07:54.590 --> 00:07:56.240
They're not here.

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:59.000
W-What gives, Bushy-Brows?

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:01.250
Sakura will be thrilled 
if I buy a bunch―

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:02.150
Nice!

00:08:02.150 --> 00:08:03.370
Sold, sold!

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:09.470
How many people are there?

00:08:09.470 --> 00:08:11.580
We need to hurry.

00:08:09.470 --> 00:08:12.530
<b>Checkout</b>

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:14.430
That woman at the front's buying a lot.

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:16.540
We've got no choice.

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:18.560
Excuse me, grandma!

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:21.830
Buying all that makeup won't 
make you young again.

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:26.590
Oh? Thanks for the tip.

00:08:33.380 --> 00:08:38.040
Where the heck are Naruto 
and Mr. Bushy-Brows?

00:08:40.680 --> 00:08:42.990
Of all people, it had 
to be Lady Tsunade...

00:08:42.990 --> 00:08:44.780
Why me, too?

00:08:44.780 --> 00:08:46.920
You just had to open your 
big mouth, Bushy-Brows!

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:48.470
So did you!

00:08:48.470 --> 00:08:50.120
It's your fault!

00:08:50.120 --> 00:08:51.910
It's yours!

00:08:51.910 --> 00:08:54.130
Naruto, Mr. Bushy-Brows!

00:08:55.420 --> 00:08:56.790
What's up, Konohamaru?

00:08:56.790 --> 00:09:02.060
Big trouble! Some punks are 
flirting with Sakura and Tenten!

00:09:02.380 --> 00:09:05.890
I tried to protect them,
but they were too much for me!

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:07.700
Sakura and Tenten...

00:09:07.700 --> 00:09:08.810
Bushy-Brows...

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:10.650
I know we've been fighting all day...

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:11.980
Say no more.

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:14.590
Truce!

00:09:28.180 --> 00:09:29.980
C'mon, doll face!

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:33.460
We'll go eat some of the old capital's 
famous extra-thick ramen.

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:36.050
They put green onions on the top.

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:38.700
We're not going with you!

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:39.720
Right, Sakura?

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:40.520
Yeah!

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:42.480
I don't like thick ramen. 
I prefer it to be soupy!

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:43.680
That's the issue?!

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:45.730
You may be kinda cute...

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:50.110
And I'm being nice, so don't get sassy!

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:53.150
You're going out with us even 
if we have to force you!

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:54.610
Hold it!

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:57.310
That voice...

00:09:57.310 --> 00:09:58.490
Lee?

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:06.160
Hey, it's those guys!

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:07.790
Let's do it, Naruto!

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:09.170
Roger!

00:10:14.310 --> 00:10:17.010
This is dumb, this is so dumb!

00:10:18.240 --> 00:10:20.640
There's no point in you 
trying to copy him!

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:23.100
What's with these guys?

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:24.430
Take this!

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:26.900
Shimura-Style Clones Secret Strike!

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:28.980
Flip the Bird!

00:10:40.930 --> 00:10:45.450
Naruto, we've been so silly, 
fighting amongst ourselves.

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:48.910
Yeah, we've finally got 
some vacation time.

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:51.290
It'll be more fun if we work together!

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:55.410
Good lord.

00:10:55.410 --> 00:10:57.460
That was kinda cool!

00:10:57.460 --> 00:10:59.800
I don't get all the outfits...

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:03.050
Let's go buy some souvenirs. 
Come on, you two!

00:11:03.450 --> 00:11:05.060
Sakura!

00:11:05.980 --> 00:11:11.470
Thus, Naruto and Lee overcame 
their differences and made up.

00:11:11.470 --> 00:11:14.340
They went shopping with 
the rest of the group.

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:16.020
But...

00:11:16.970 --> 00:11:19.240
The instructors quickly heard 
about the ruckus they caused,

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:23.300
and the two friends were forced 
to sit on their knees together.

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:25.410
And they lived happily ever after.

00:11:26.560 --> 00:11:28.090
Why me, too?

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:40.550
And so night fell on the field trip 
we're calling a training excursion.

00:11:44.190 --> 00:11:46.310
It's now past curfew.

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:49.120
And when she turned around, she saw...

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:52.080
Man, Konohamaru's taking forever.

00:11:53.570 --> 00:11:54.730
Got 'em!

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:57.640
Good work, Konohamaru.

00:11:57.640 --> 00:11:59.880
Took you long enough.

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:02.490
Give me a break, Naruto.

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:05.830
If the instructors caught me,
I'd have to sit on my knees all night.

00:12:05.830 --> 00:12:08.030
My heart was racing.

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:13.540
Okay, our night begins now!

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:15.580
Cheers!

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:32.360
<b>Girls' Rooms and Candy Boxes</b>

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:35.560
Guys, I'm sorry.

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:40.040
You should know what happens 
when you run with drinks!

00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:41.280
Easy, Naruto.

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:43.780
What're we gonna do now?

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:45.110
There's only one thing to do.

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:48.660
Go to the girls' room to hang out.

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:50.870
The girls' room?

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:55.330
When you're on a training excursion 
that's really a field trip,

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:57.700
sneaking off to hang out with 
the girls in their room...

00:12:58.690 --> 00:13:00.450
...is the climax of the whole event!

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:03.470
Nice idea, Bushy-Brows!

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:04.970
You can count me in!

00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:07.200
I wonder if they have snacks...

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:08.720
Of course they do.

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:11.990
A girls' room is like one 
big box of sweet treats.

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:14.210
You want to come, too, right, Neji?

00:13:14.210 --> 00:13:15.640
Not especially...

00:13:16.300 --> 00:13:20.770
Then again, you oafs might try 
something funny with Lady Hinata...

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:24.490
I guess I'll tag a long, 
just to chaperon.

00:13:25.170 --> 00:13:26.490
Yeah!

00:13:27.400 --> 00:13:28.940
You're up for this, right, Shikamaru?

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:30.050
Too troublesome.

00:13:30.050 --> 00:13:32.330
I'm not gonna bother sneaking 
off to hang with some girls.

00:13:32.680 --> 00:13:33.940
Shikamaru...

00:13:33.940 --> 00:13:35.980
You're so lame.

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:38.170
Well, we can't force him.

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:41.100
So? What's the plan?

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:47.050
For starters, we don't even know which
room Tenten and the others are in.

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:52.190
And if the instructors catch us,
we'll be sitting on our knees 'til sunrise.

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:56.370
Right...

00:13:56.370 --> 00:13:59.830
Okay, I'll go scouting 
and find the girls' room!

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:02.020
I need to make up for the 
fiasco with the drinks!

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:03.530
You're sure you can do it?

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:06.990
Mr. Bushy-Brows, please 
have faith in me!

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:09.000
All right.

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:10.570
We're counting on you, Konohamaru!

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.080
Wow, Sakura, they're awesome!

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:21.090
Let me see again!

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:22.460
C'mon, c'mon, c'mon!

00:14:25.870 --> 00:14:27.620
Um... I...

00:14:27.620 --> 00:14:28.580
Soft drink?

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:37.230
Man, Konohamaru's taking forever.

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:39.260
Something must've gone wrong.

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:41.240
Maybe the senseis caught him.

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:42.770
I'll go take a look.

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:00.790
<i>Sensei, pawn to 2-D.</i>

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:02.520
This...

00:15:03.550 --> 00:15:05.540
Definitely Konohamaru's handwriting.

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:06.800
What's it say?

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:08.040
Hm...

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:12.390
"The girls' are in the last room
at the north end of the hall."

00:15:12.710 --> 00:15:15.970
Looks like Konohamaru 
succeeded after all.

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:19.080
But where is the man himself?

00:15:22.620 --> 00:15:24.150
Neji, you're up.

00:15:24.600 --> 00:15:25.650
Byakugan!

00:15:37.670 --> 00:15:39.290
Neji!

00:15:41.860 --> 00:15:44.440
I saw something no man should see...

00:15:44.440 --> 00:15:45.960
Say what?

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:47.320
A murder site?

00:15:47.320 --> 00:15:49.600
A wandering ghost?

00:15:49.600 --> 00:15:52.300
Konohamaru's stuck sitting on his knees...

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:54.550
We were right.

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:59.980
Poor Konohamaru sacrificed himself
to leave us this precious letter!

00:16:00.400 --> 00:16:01.780
Konohamaru!

00:16:01.780 --> 00:16:05.120
He grew up into a man 
while we weren't looking!

00:16:05.120 --> 00:16:06.980
Is it really worth crying over?

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:09.570
We can't let Konohamaru's 
sacrifice go to waste!

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:12.380
We must make it to the girls' room!

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:13.630
Yeah!

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:17.080
I think you all just want 
to go there regardless.

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:22.130
Now what do we do?

00:16:22.130 --> 00:16:25.900
If we just walk by the instructors room,
we'll get busted.

00:16:25.900 --> 00:16:29.630
Yeah. We're up against Kakashi Sensei 
and Bushier-Brows Sensei here.

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:31.350
Are you guys serious?

00:16:31.350 --> 00:16:33.320
It's time to snatch defeat 
from the jaws of victory!

00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:35.540
We should charge forward and 
to heck with the consequences!

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:38.860
I think you mean,
 "Victory from the jaws of defeat."

00:16:38.860 --> 00:16:41.100
The jaws of defeat... That's it!

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:44.280
We send someone inside their room,

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:46.380
splash drinks or something 
on their clothes,

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:48.820
and soak them good.

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:52.860
The two of them will run off 
to the big bath to clean up.

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:52.860
<b>Big Bath</b>

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:57.700
And we'll use the chance to run to 
the last room on the north end.

00:16:58.100 --> 00:16:59.250
Wow, Neji!

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:00.590
Nice idea!

00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:02.260
Let's make it happen!

00:17:02.260 --> 00:17:05.710
It's funny 'cause at first, 
you didn't wanna go, Neji.

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:12.210
Sensei...

00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:16.430
<i>Mr. Bushy-Brows.</i>

00:17:17.380 --> 00:17:20.230
<i>Konohamaru, we've got a plan.</i>

00:17:20.230 --> 00:17:22.350
<i>We'll make the two of them 
run off to the bath,</i>

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:23.560
<i>and open a path to victory!</i>

00:17:23.990 --> 00:17:27.100
<i>Wow! You haven't given up yet!</i>

00:17:27.920 --> 00:17:29.310
What's wrong, Lee?

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:30.930
You don't look well.

00:17:30.930 --> 00:17:33.230
Sensei, I've got a fever.

00:17:33.230 --> 00:17:35.360
Do you have something cold to drink?

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:37.070
Something cold?

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:38.530
Let me check.

00:17:41.320 --> 00:17:42.750
Here, drink up.

00:17:44.230 --> 00:17:45.630
<i>Now's my chance.</i>

00:17:45.630 --> 00:17:48.790
I just have to pretend to sneeze 
and do a Leaf Whirlwind...

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:50.090
Ah...

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:51.340
Ah...

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:55.040
Achoo!

00:17:58.910 --> 00:18:02.930
<i>Shoot! I missed!</i>

00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:04.850
What kinda sneeze was that?!

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:06.900
That idiot screwed it all up!

00:18:06.900 --> 00:18:08.690
Choji, plan B!

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:12.780
Sensei, I'm thirsty!

00:18:12.780 --> 00:18:15.300
<i>He's not even acting?!</i>

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:17.740
Huh? Oh, help yourself 
to what's on the table.

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:20.680
Thanks!

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:23.190
<i>He's just drinking everything...</i>

00:18:23.190 --> 00:18:25.900
<i>Choji, please don't forget the plan.</i>

00:18:25.900 --> 00:18:27.710
Oh, yeah.

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:34.990
You guys stink...

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:37.980
Excuse me!

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:42.050
I started a fire and I can't put it out,
can you do it for me?!

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:44.680
<i>That's way too implausible, Naruto!</i>

00:18:45.070 --> 00:18:46.140
Fine...

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:47.700
Water style,

00:18:48.280 --> 00:18:49.480
Bucket Relay!

00:18:56.230 --> 00:18:57.970
Now go to bed!

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:03.120
<i>Naruto and Mr. Bushy-Brows' 
plan totally failed.</i>

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:05.590
Boy, those kids...

00:19:05.590 --> 00:19:07.200
Now I'm thirsty.

00:19:09.880 --> 00:19:12.420
Oh, yeah, Choji drank everything.

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:13.590
Sensei!

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:16.340
I've still got the two 
drinks I bought earlier.

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:18.140
That's very nice of you!

00:19:18.140 --> 00:19:19.340
Thanks a million.

00:19:26.220 --> 00:19:28.560
You can't shake carbonated drinks!

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:33.030
My... eyes!

00:19:34.030 --> 00:19:36.900
Now the two of them will have 
to go to the inn's bath!

00:19:38.100 --> 00:19:40.240
They got their own private shower?!

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:41.360
Hurry, hurry!

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:44.120
The faucet won't turn...

00:19:46.130 --> 00:19:47.150
This is...

00:19:47.150 --> 00:19:49.250
Shikamaru's Shadow Pull!

00:19:55.720 --> 00:19:56.590
Sheesh...

00:19:57.320 --> 00:19:59.720
You guys are so troublesome.

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:00.960
Shikamaru!

00:20:00.960 --> 00:20:02.260
Nice one!

00:20:03.730 --> 00:20:05.780
Forget it, I'm going 
to the inn's big bath!

00:20:05.780 --> 00:20:06.840
Wait up!

00:20:08.230 --> 00:20:09.890
We did it!

00:20:10.430 --> 00:20:12.250
You guys rule!

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:15.370
We're past Guy Sensei 
and Kakashi Sensei!

00:20:15.370 --> 00:20:17.610
To the girls' room! Full speed ahead!

00:20:20.180 --> 00:20:21.730
We made it.

00:20:21.730 --> 00:20:22.450
Yeah.

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:26.080
It's all thanks to Konohamaru 
bravely leaving the letter.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:29.750
I'm proud of you, Konohamaru.

00:20:31.490 --> 00:20:32.750
Naruto...

00:20:35.730 --> 00:20:37.370
By the way, what letter?

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:40.520
All I did was get caught and 
sit on my knees all night.

00:20:40.520 --> 00:20:42.720
Then who wrote...

00:20:51.590 --> 00:20:52.350
Huh?

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:56.770
Let us explain.

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:01.610
The letter Lee's group 
thought was from Konohamaru

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:02.630
was actually written by Kakashi,

00:21:02.630 --> 00:21:06.270
using the Sharingan to 
copy his handwriting.

00:21:08.290 --> 00:21:10.880
For the record, Tenten, 
Sakura and the girls...

00:21:10.880 --> 00:21:13.410
...were in the second to last room 
on the north end of the hall,

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:15.920
while Lady Tsunade 
occupied the last one.

00:21:16.240 --> 00:21:19.340
No!

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:25.130
You boys have guts!

00:21:33.780 --> 00:21:38.970
In the end, Lee and the boys played 
right into Kakashi and Guy's hands.

00:21:38.970 --> 00:21:43.650
They sat there on their knees 
 until the sun came up.

00:23:21.410 --> 00:23:22.840
Guy, the preview.

00:23:22.840 --> 00:23:25.560
Oh, yeah, I'm gonna do it 
while sitting on my knees.

00:23:25.560 --> 00:23:27.590
Why are you sitting on your knees, too?

00:23:27.590 --> 00:23:30.300
I'm not gonna make the 
kids do all the training,

00:23:30.300 --> 00:23:31.500
I want to train, too.

00:23:31.500 --> 00:23:32.850
Oh. Whatever.

00:23:33.420 --> 00:23:38.170
Next week is "The No-Ninjutsu Lifestyle,"

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:41.350
<b>The No-Ninjutsu Lifestyle
I want to Share an Umbrella with Sakura</b>

00:23:38.170 --> 00:23:41.350
and "I want to Share an 
Umbrella with Sakura."

00:23:41.350 --> 00:23:42.860
Whew! My legs are numb!

00:23:42.860 --> 00:23:44.700
You handle the rest, Kakashi.

00:23:44.700 --> 00:23:46.150
Would you pay attention?!

00:23:46.150 --> 00:23:47.740
Wait, you're numb already?!
